# Load a saved map's keyframe patches and refine their poses offline with
# hierarchical bundle adjustment (HBA / BALM). Served by hba_node
# (`syncai_mapping`, in SyncAI-Robot-Workspace) on the relative name
# `refine_map`, so it lands on <robot_id>/hba/refine_map. Not part of any
# session and not called by the backend: an operator runs the node by hand
# after a mapping drive. Moved here from SyncAI-Fast-LIO2's `interface`
# package in 2026-09 with the node that serves it.
#
# maps_path is the map directory save_maps wrote with save_patches: true --
# it must contain patches/<i>.pcd and poses.txt (see SaveMaps.srv for the
# layout). The service returns as soon as the patches are loaded; the
# optimisation itself runs on the node's timer afterwards, hba_iter passes,
# and `map_points` shows the map being refined. SavePoses writes the result.
string maps_path
---
bool success
string message
